   "lines": [
    "Went to Chestnut Hill",
    "to coast on \"toborgans\",",
    "or \"crust runners\". Besides",
    "Alice and Rose, Lulu",
    "Lane, Nana Rotch and",
    "Bessie Whitney were out",
    "there. The fellows were",
    "Dick S., Minot W.; Jack",
    "Tebbets, Ell Whitney",
    "Tom Lee and myself.",
    "We had capital",
    "fun. Alice, Miss",
    "Whitney, Dick & I",
    "coasted on the same",
    "torbogan."
   ],
   "rows": null,
